**RVV Instructions:**

| Instruction | Description | Assembly Format |
|-------------|-------------|-----------------|
| `vaadd.vv` | Vector-vector signed averaging add | `vaadd.vv vd, vs2, vs1, vm` |
| `vaadd.vx` | Vector-scalar signed averaging add | `vaadd.vx vd, vs2, rs1, vm` |
| `vaaddu.vv` | Vector-vector unsigned averaging add | `vaaddu.vv vd, vs2, vs1, vm` |
| `vaaddu.vx` | Vector-scalar unsigned averaging add | `vaaddu.vx vd, vs2, rs1, vm` |

**Operands:** `vd` = destination, `vs2` = first source vector, `vs1`/`rs1` = second source (vector/scalar), `vm` = mask (v0.t or omitted). Rounding mode from `vxrm` (rnu, rne, rdn, rod) applies to the LSB before right shift.

**Matching Intrinsics:**

```c
