- `rd`: scalar destination (XLEN-bit integer register)
- `vs2`: source mask register (v0-v31, only v0-v15 in standard configurations)
- `vm`: optional mask (`v0.t` or omitted for unmasked)

**Assembly format:**
```
vfirst.m rd, vs2
vfirst.m rd, vs2, v0.t
